WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In the invisible-gorilla experiment, looking and noticing were not the same thing.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
That is a finding about attention—not a clinical test of meditation audio.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12's seller describes twelve-minute sessions and four listening styles.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A short format is useful to some listeners. Hour-long equivalence is not independently proven.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes with a free timer before deciding what audio to buy.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Review the science. Check the terms. Choose freely.
